    "description": "Comprehensive collection for all REST endpoints with positive, negative, edge, and corner-case scenarios.\n\nUsage notes:\n1) Run db/seed_bmsdec24.sql once in MySQL Workbench to load deterministic data.\n2) Set collection variables before running positive ticket scenarios:\n   - baseUrl (default: http://localhost:8080)\n   - validShowId\n   - validShowSeatIds\n3) Signup folder generates unique email and stores signedUpUserId.\n4) Ticket happy-flow requests store ticketId automatically.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
